<script>
	import { DocsCopyTable } from '$lib/components/docs';
	import tokens from '@aesir/tokens/tokens.json';

	const steps = Object.entries(tokens.opacity).map(([token, definition]) => ({
		token,
		value: Number.parseFloat(definition?.$value ?? definition?.value ?? definition)
	}));

	const columns = [
		{ key: 'token', label: 'Token', width: 'var(--ds-spacing-20)', code: true },
		{ key: 'valueLabel', label: 'Value', width: 'var(--ds-spacing-20)' },
		{ key: 'percent', label: '%', width: 'var(--ds-spacing-20)' },
		{ key: 'visual', label: 'Visual', kind: 'custom' }
	];

	const rows = steps.map((step) => ({
		id: step.token,
		token: step.token,
		value: step.value,
		valueLabel: step.value.toFixed(2).replace(/\.?0+$/, ''),
		percent: `${Math.round(step.value * 100)}%`,
		copyValue: `var(--ds-opacity-${step.token})`
	}));
</script>

# Opacity

Opacity tokens define reusable transparency levels for overlays, disabled states, and subtle emphasis.

## Scale

<DocsCopyTable {columns} {rows} copyLabel="Token copied">
	{#snippet renderCell(row, column)}
		{#if column.key === 'visual'}
			<td class="opacity-preview-cell">
				<div class="token-track">
					<div class="token-track__value" style="opacity: {row.value}"></div>
				</div>
			</td>
		{/if}
	{/snippet}
</DocsCopyTable>

## Usage

```css
.disabled { opacity: var(--ds-opacity-60); }
```

Use `opacity` when the entire element should fade. To change only a color channel, compose the color token with transparency:

```css
.subtle-border {
  --border-opacity: calc(var(--ds-opacity-60) * 100%);
  border-color: color-mix(
    in oklch,
    var(--ds-border) var(--border-opacity),
    transparent
  );
}
```

The same pattern works with `--ds-accent`, background, foreground and semantic status colors.

## Design tokens

Opacity is defined in `packages/tokens/src/shared/foundations.json` under `opacity` and exported to CSS, Figma, and Penpot token files.

<style>
	.opacity-preview-cell {
		padding: var(--ds-spacing-3);
	}

	.token-track {
		width: 100%;
		height: var(--ds-spacing-3);
		overflow: hidden;
		border-radius: var(--ds-radius-sm);
		background: var(--ds-surface);
	}

	.token-track__value {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		border-radius: inherit;
		background: var(--ds-accent);
	}
</style>
